            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We have focused our attention on some forms of mixed back pain associated to psychological disturbances. After a set of through multidisciplinary test, the patients were administered different therapics, both symptomatic and pharmacological. For its social importance we suggest to start the idoneus therapy as soon as possible.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
